        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 4019/500-US32D, 16\" Stainless Steel Offset Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Stainless Steel Offset Door Handle has a 16\" Center to Center mounting points with a total length of 17-1/2\". This Pull is most often used on commercial doors such as restaurant doors, store entry doors, and office entry doors. The simple styling makes it easy to maintain, with no cracks or crevices to trap grime. It is made out of stainless steel and has a satin stainless steel finish.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: \r\n<a href=\"/products/8-inch-stainless-steel-offset-door-pull-omnia-4019-300-us32d\"><b>8\" Stainless Offset Door Pull</b></a> and \r\n<a href=\"/products/12-inch-stainless-steel-offset-door-pull-omnia-4019-400-us32d\"><b>12\" Stainless Offset Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia 4019/500-US32D Offset Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 16\" (500 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 17-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/omnia-pull-mounting-btb.pdf?v=1704262187\" target=\"new\"><b>Omnia Pull Back to Back Mounting Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n<BR><BR>\r\n<p><B>***THIS ITEM IS DISCONTINUED, LIMITED STOCK AVAILABLE***</b></p>\r\n<BR><BR>",
